# Figma → UX Review: Full Workflow Visual Map (v2 — Merged CP)

## Pipeline Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    PIPE 1: figma-to-prd-md                          │
│  Figma URL → Metadata → Screenshots → Boundaries → OCR → .md pack  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                    PIPE 2: ux-review-pipe                            │
│  .md pack + ui/*.png → Skill A + B + C → ux-review-report.md        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Execution Flow

```
USER INPUT (figma_url, product_name, domain, output_dir)
  │
  ▼
═══ Bước 0: PRE-FLIGHT (T-1..T-9) ═══════════════════════════
  │
  ▼
═══ Bước 1: KHỞI TẠO INPUT ══════════════════════════════════
  │ 🛑 GATE 0: Output Folder Guard [Human CP — T3]
  │   Folder rỗng? → PASS
  │   Có data? → [A] Empty / [B] Change / [C] Abort
  ▼
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  Bước 2: PIPE 1 — figma-to-prd-md                          ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
  │
  ├── Phase 0 & 1 ── Parse Structure (get_metadata → XML)
  │     ▼
  │   Phase 1d ── Save Screenshots ═════════════════ CRITICAL
  │     │  figma-save-to-ui.sh per section
  │     ▼
  │   ⛔ GATE A ── Screenshot Existence [Script T1]
  │     📌 CP1: Xả XML body. Giữ: provisional_boundaries
  │
  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  │ CAN PARALLEL:                               │
  │  │  Screenshots ↕ Single-Pass Extraction       │
  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  │
  │  ═══ 2-ROUND BOUNDARY REFINEMENT ═══════════════
  │  │
  │  ├── 2a-bis ── Boundary Detection Round 1 ·····
  │  │     │  Bước 1: List artboards
  │  │     │  Bước 2: Group by Figma name
  │  │     │  Bước 2.5: Icon fingerprint per artboard
  │  │     │  Bước 3: ★ TEXT + ICON → flow-stage → boundaries
  │  │     │  Bước 4: Output provisional_boundaries[] ← NOT FINAL
  │  │     │  Bước 5: Self-check (Boundary Gate — automated)
  │  │     │
  │  │     │  ⚠️ Agent: KHÔNG DỪNG. Boundaries provisional.
  │  │     ▼
  │  ├── 2a-pre ── Single-Pass Extraction ·········
  │  │     │  text_nodes[] + icon_fingerprint[] + icon_inventory[]
  │  │     ▼
  │  │   ⚠️ GATE D ── Icon Validation [Agent T2] (automated, WARNING only)
  │  │     ▼
  │  ├── 2d ── Flow + Icon Trigger Inference (Round 2) ·
  │  │     │  2d.1: Text-based flow
  │  │     │  2d.2: Agent reasoning icon triggers
  │  │     │  2d.3: Boundary annotation (annotate, NOT restructure)
  │  │     │  2d.4: → flow_graph.json
  │  │     │  2d.5: ★ Boundary Consistency Check (NEW)
  │  │     │         SUGGEST_MERGE / SUGGEST_SPLIT flags
  │  │     ▼
  │  │   ⛔ GATE E ── Flow Graph Validation [Agent T2] (automated)
  │  │     │
  │  │     ▼
  │  ╚═════════════════════════════════════════════════
  │     │
  │     ▼
  │   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │   │  🛑 MERGED HUMAN CHECKPOINT [T3]                         │
  │   │  3 Tabs — user sees ALL data BEFORE lock                 │
  │   │                                                          │
  │   │  Tab 1: BOUNDARIES (from 2a-bis)                         │
  │   │    • Screen boundaries table (provisional)               │
  │   │    • Artboards per biên detail                           │
  │   │    • Boundary Gate 4 assertions                          │
  │   │                                                          │
  │   │  Tab 2: FLOW GRAPH (from 2d)                             │
  │   │    • Flow edges (text + icon triggers)                   │
  │   │    • Boundary flags (SUGGEST_MERGE/SPLIT from 2d.5)      │
  │   │    • Gate E 5 assertions                                 │
  │   │                                                          │
  │   │  Tab 3: ICON INVENTORY (from Gate D)                     │
  │   │    • Icons per screen table                              │
  │   │    • Categories breakdown                                │
  │   │    • Gate D results                                      │
  │   │                                                          │
  │   │  [Y] → LOCK boundaries, continue pipeline                │
  │   │  [E] → Edit boundaries, redo 2a-bis..2d (~1-2 min)       │
  │   │  [N] → STOP pipeline                                     │
  │   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  │     │
  │     │  📌 CP2: Xả icon raw + reasoning. Giữ: locked boundaries, flow_graph
  │     ▼
  │   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │   │  🏷️ NAMING SYNC (sau lock, trước 2f)                     │
  │   │  Per screen:                                             │
  │   │    main_screen_name_vi ← sub_sections[].name             │
  │   │    screen_type_label_vi ← mapping(screen_type)           │
  │   │    display_name_vi ← "{main} › {sub}"                    │
  │   │  → Dùng display_name_vi cho toàn bộ downstream           │
  │   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  │     ▼
  ├── 2f ── Mapping ảnh ↔ biên (locked) ···········
  │     ▼
  ├── 2g ── OCR per biên (Agent Vision) ···········
  │     │  Round 1: text │ Round 2: icons → ocr_full_table[k]
  │     │  📌 CP3: Xả OCR raw
  │     ▼
  ├── Phase 3 ── Gen PRD Draft (1 biên = 1 .md) ──
  │     ▼
  ├── Phase 4 ── Augment PRD (DDL + signal inference)
  │     ▼
  ├── Phase 5 ── Output + Handoff (.handoff/) ─────
  │     ▼
  │   ⛔ GATE F ── Handoff Completeness [Agent T2]
  │     📌 CP4: Xả Phase 2-5 in-memory
  │     ▼
  │   ⛔ GATE B ── OCR Data Validation [Script T1]
  │     📌 CP5: Xả Pipe 1 context
  │
  ▼
═══ Bước 3: HANDOFF PREPARATION ═══════════════════════════
  │  Load consumer_payload from .handoff/
  ▼
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  Bước 4: PIPE 2 — ux-review-pipe                           ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
  │
  │   ⛔ GATE C ── Vision File Check [Script T1]
  │     ▼
  │   ┌──────────────┬──────────────┐
  │   │   Skill A    │   Skill B    │  ← PARALLEL
  │   │ Signal+DDL   │ PRD Context  │
  │   │ (text only)  │ (text only)  │
  │   └──────┬───────┴──────┬───────┘
  │          └──────┬───────┘
  │                 ▼
  │          ┌──────────────┐
  │          │   Skill C    │  ← SEQUENTIAL (needs A+B)
  │          │ Vision Review│
  │          │ ★ reads PNG  │
  │          └──────────────┘
  │
  ▼
═══ Bước 5: TỔNG HỢP ════════════════════════════════════
  │  5.1: → ux-review-report.md
  │  5.2: ⛔ SCORE GATE [Script T1]
  │        📌 CP6: Pipeline hoàn tất
  ▼
DONE ✅
```

