## Gate Summary

```
Chronological order:

Gate 0 ──🛑── Output Folder Guard         [Human CP T3]   Bước 1
Gate A ──🔧── Screenshot Existence         [Script T1]     Phase 1d
Boundary─🤖── 4 Assertions (automated)    [Agent T2]      Phase 2a-bis
Gate D ──🤖── Icon Validation (automated)  [Agent T2]      Phase 2a-pre
Gate E ──🤖── Flow Graph (automated)       [Agent T2]      Phase 2d.4
Merged ──🛑── Boundaries+Flow+Icons        [Human CP T3]   Sau Gate E ★ LOCK POINT
Gate F ──🤖── Handoff Completeness         [Agent T2]      Phase 5
Gate B ──🔧── OCR Data Validation          [Script T1]     Pre-Bước 3
Gate C ──🔧── Vision File Check            [Script T1]     Pre-Skill C
Score  ──🔧── UX Score Calculator          [Script T1]     Bước 5.2
```

## Context Checkpoints

```
CP1 ── Sau Gate A      ── Xả: figma_raw XML
                          Giữ: provisional_boundaries, screen_ids

CP2 ── Sau Merged CP   ── Xả: icon_inventory raw, reasoning
                          Giữ: locked boundaries, flow_graph, annotations

CP3 ── Sau Phase 2g    ── Xả: ocr_round1_text, ocr_round2_icons
                          Giữ: ocr_full_table, ocr_gaps

CP4 ── Sau Gate F      ── Xả: ALL Phase 2-5 in-memory
                          Giữ: .handoff/ file paths

CP5 ── Sau Handoff     ── Xả: ALL Pipe 1 context
                          Giữ: consumer_payload (from file)

CP6 ── Sau Score       ── Xả: ALL
                          Giữ: ux-review-report.md path
```

## Parallel Opportunities

```
CAN RUN IN PARALLEL:
┌─────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┐
│ Phase 1d: Screenshots   │ Phase 2a-pre: Extraction │
│ (download from Figma)   │ (parse metadata XML)     │
└─────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┐
│ Skill A: Signal+DDL     │ Skill B: PRD Context     │
│ (inference from text)   │ (parse from .md)         │
└─────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────┘

MUST BE SEQUENTIAL:
  2a-pre → 2a-bis (boundaries need text+icon data)
  2a-bis → 2d (flow needs provisional boundaries)
  Boundary Gate + Gate D + Gate E → Merged CP (all automated gates before human)
  Merged CP [Y] → 2f → 2g (OCR needs locked boundaries)
  Skill A+B → Skill C (C needs reports from A+B)
```

## Key Design Decision: Merged CP

```
BEFORE (v1):                         AFTER (v2 — current):
  2a-bis                               2a-bis
    ▼                                     ▼
  🛑 Boundary CP ← poor data           Boundary Gate (automated)
    │ user waits + confirms               ▼
    ▼                                   2a-pre → Gate D
  Gate D → 2d → Gate E                    ▼
    │ rich data, user doesn't see       2d → Gate E
    ▼                                     ▼
  continue...                           🛑 Merged CP ← RICH data
                                          │ user sees: boundaries + flow + icons
                                          │ THEN confirms
                                          ▼
                                        continue (2f → 2g → ...)

Benefits:
  • Data quality at lock point: ⭐⭐ → ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
  • User interrupts: 2 → 1
  • Reject rate: ~20% → ~5%
  • Redo cost if reject: 0 → ~1-2 min (acceptable)
```
